│ Help · Linear                                                                                                        │
│ The project's Linear board: your personal Linear connection, and the board this project is linked to. Task ownership │
│ comes from the coordinator's issue assignment; selecting a row never claims or completes work. In Intake (n), only a │
│ needs-agent label, delegation or mention a trusted person makes in Linear itself counts; signals made through        │
│ ClawBridge run as the app and are never trusted.                                                                     │
